  "notes": "Runtime-wiring repair: forces visible labels on Randomize Section, Randomize Character, and Undo Randomize with standard WinForms buttons; makes Nickname(s) randomization explicit for the field button, section randomization, and full-character randomization; and replaces the subtle page effect with a clearly visible parchment page fold across the gutter for section changes and Previous/Next character navigation. Preserves all 182 character-sheet fields, locks, undo, portrait controls, autosave, scrolling/focus fixes, saved browsing state, and the open-book icon."
